    happinessModifier: 1
    educationModifier: 0
  - title: "M\u1EB7c k\u1EC7"
    description: "Coi nh\u01B0 \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 \"vitamin th\xEAm\" v\xE0 b\u1EA3o
